# Stall Out: "target creature or Vehicle". Bot2's Smuggler's Copter is a Vehicle that is not a creature (nobody crewed it) and is a
# legal target (CR 205.3g): it is tapped and gets three stun counters, which also keeps it from untapping next turn (CR 122.1d).
# Bot2's Sol Ring is an artifact that is neither, so it is refused as a target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Stall Out
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Smuggler's Copter
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Stall Out.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring)
Bot1.Hand.Stall Out.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Counters.Stun = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Counters.Stun = (absent)
